Package: plink4r
Type: Package
Title: Genotype and Summary-Statistics Imputation from Eigen LD Blocks
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Yihe", "Yang", email = "yxy1234@case.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A toolkit for PLINK BED / PGEN genotypes. geno_open() reads a file with the bundled pgenlib into a
    compact 2-bit + int16 store behind an external pointer; geno_harmonise(), genotype_fill(), geno_subset() and
    geno_merge() prepare that pointer (counted allele, missing cells, samples and variants, several loci), and
    its products (X'X, X'M, X B, weighted cross products, correlations) are computed on the store, from R or
    from other packages' compiled code through inst/include/plink4r_api.h. Basic analyses read the files in
    blocks: association (gwas) and gene-environment interaction (gxe), with an optional sparse kinship, and
    scores (geno_score). Missing genotype cells and missing GWAS summary statistics are imputed from blockwise
    eigen LD (SBayesRC or plink4r eigen.bin layout), with OpenMP parallelism. Summary-statistics imputation is
    ported from SBayesRC.QC2.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: data.table, arrow, Rcpp, stats, utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: GNU make
